	(text_box "1. Function: Option B LDO Board V3 is the 22.69 x 40.30 mm 6-layer HDI headstage power & signal carrier that mates the unchanged Artix-7 Frontend FPGA Board (J1/J2 DF40C-70DP, PIN_MAP_V8) to the shared Option B Router V3 (J5/J6 DF40C-80DP, PIN_MAP_B_V2). Sheet 1 generates all nine ASIC supply rails from VIN_3V3 (+3.3 V -> +/-12 V LT3582-12 -> +/-8.06 V LT3042/LT3094; 3x LT3042 analog/reference rails; 4x TPS7A2015PDBVR 1.50 V rails) with delayed enable. Sheet 2 ties J5/J6 rails, houses the single AGND-GND star tie NT1, 17 x 1 uF 25 V port capacitors, and 17 safe-idle pull resistors.\n\n2. Source / changes: Built by Antigravity (25 Nov 2026) from FPGA-LDO A V24 / schematic V43 (19 Nov 2026) and Option B Router V3 contract review (SYNTHESIS.md §3 & §5, PIN_MAP_B_V2.csv, PIN_MAP_V8.csv). Resolves all V2->V3 gaps and JLC stock blockers: replaces V2's 120-pin J5 with 2x DF40C-80DP (J5/J6); updates stim rails to +/-8.06 V (80.6k), adds R802 (47k REF_VCM min load), R20-R28 safe-idle pulls, 17x C52923 port caps, TP13/18/19/20; swaps out-of-stock TPS7A2015PDQNR (C2862700) to genuine TI TPS7A2015PDBVR (C2877859, SOT-23-5, matching Carrier V7); unifies all 28 x 1 uF 0402 caps on C52923 Basic 25 V. Stock read 2026-11-25 07:31 CST."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
